## 2. Provenance: files __HOLDER__ did not write

This plugin is scaffolded from the TAK-SDK's `plugintemplate` sample, so parts of
this repository originate with the TAK Product Center. Those parts remain subject
to the TAK Software License Agreement, and the license above covers only
__HOLDER__'s own work. Where the two meet in one file, it applies to the
modifications.

**From the TAK-SDK `plugintemplate` sample**, essentially unchanged:

- `app/src/main/java/com/atakmap/android/__PKG__/plugin/PluginNativeLoader.java`
- `build.gradle`, `settings.gradle`, `gradle.properties`, `gradle/versions.gradle`
- `app/build.gradle` and `app/proguard-gradle.txt`, with this plugin's version,
  target and keep rules edited in
- `template.local.properties`
- the `com.atakmap.app.component` declaration in `app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml`

**Derived from the template and substantially rewritten** (the license applies
to the changes). List what is actually on disk:
`ls app/src/main/java/com/atakmap/android/__PKG__/plugin/*.java`

